### 4.03 【PDF-03】 Giang et al. (2026) : Digital transformation, dynamic capability, and innovation performance in SMEs

- **書誌情報**: Giang, P. X., Vi, T. T. T., & Ghi, T. N. (2026). *Digital transformation, dynamic capability, and innovation performance in SMEs*. Journal of Organizational Behavior Research, 11(1), 198–206.
